<title>FRANCE: French Q4 non-farm payrolls data due on Feb 21.</title>
<headline>French Q4 non-farm payrolls data due on Feb 21.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary data on French 1996 fourth-quarter non-farm payrolls will be released by national statistics institute INSEE on February 21, INSEE said.</p>
<p>Reuters had reported in its daily agenda that the payrolls report would be published on February 12.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
